# Video editing source files and render caches (Premiere projects,
# render-preview index files, autosaves, audio previews, captured media) —
# not web assets
*.prproj
*.prin
Adobe Premiere Pro Auto-Save/
Adobe Premiere Pro Audio Previews/
Adobe Premiere Pro Captured and Generated/

# public/videos/ is where Premiere exports land alongside its project files
# above — only track videos actually served by the site (referenced from
# src/), not every raw/scratch export dropped in there
public/videos/*
!public/videos/lawlogic.mp4
